WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.560
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force, from my hand!

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:09.320
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.870
Chaos Xyz: Machine-Armored Djinn, Engeneral!

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:16.450
Chaos Xyz!

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.950
This is the power of Barian that will send you to Hell.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.540
Chaos Drain!

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.960
Now I can't use Hope's effect!

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.170
There's nowhere left for you to run!

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:31.340
What?!

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.010
Let me tell you something really good.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.450
My gang's scattered across the neighborhood.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.230
But they're going to gather here any minute now.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.140
And when they do, you and your friends are <i>truly</i> done!

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.240
Now, here I come!

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.210
I attack your Hope with Machine-Armored Djinn, Engeneral!

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.910
Hope can't use its effect if it doesn't have any Overlay Units!

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.320
But even if I take damage,

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.650
Numbers can only be destroyed by other Numbers!

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:05.020
Oh <i>really</i> now?!

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:05.760
What?!

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.230
Doom's Air Raid!

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:36.950
Impossible...!

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:40.120
My Hope... a Number... was destroyed?!

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.550
Sorry to disappoint you!

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:46.650
But a Chaos Xyz Special Summoned through Barian's Force

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:50.080
can eradicate Monster Effects that protect against destruction!

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.170
Then that means...!

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.160
Exactly.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:56.380
It means a Chaos Xyz can destroy as many Numbers as it wants!

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:00.230
It's pointless, Yuma Tsukumo.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:05.360
Chaos Xyz are Monsters made to destroy Numbers.

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.040
You have no chance of winning this.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.480
What a crazy Monster!

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.530
At this rate, Yuma's going to...

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:17.720
Look! Yuma doesn't have the Emperor's Key around his neck!

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:21.330
She's right! The key's not there!

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:27.750
To summarize, you're saying that Yuma-<i>kun</i>'s fighting alone without Astral?

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:31.710
Don't think my attack's anywhere near being over.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.450
You're going to savor every last bit of Barian's power.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:38.380
Engeneral's effect activates!

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:42.530
When Engeneral deals Battle Damage to my opponent,

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:44.930
by using all of its Chaos Overlay Units,

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:49.350
I can deal 500 damage to my opponent for each unit used!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:01.070
And I'm using all my Chaos Overlay Units, totaling four!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.950
That makes for a grand total of 2000 toward you!

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:06.770
Chaos Flash Rain!

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:24.340
Yuma... Why are you fighting by yourself...?

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:27.370
Weren't we supposed to be two souls in one body?

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:29.760
Yuma!

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:34.920
Kotori?

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.170
<i>Kotori.</i>

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.890
<i>So you're the one holding the Emperor's Key right now.</i>

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:50.950
Astral!

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:56.320
<i>Yuma's in a fight against Barian with the Numbers on the line.</i>

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:57.540
Barian?

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:01.230
<i>Take me to where Yuma is.</i>

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:01.930
But...

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.220
<i>I don't know, but...</i>

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.350
<i>Someone is trying to steal Astral away.</i>

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:08.340
<i>Eh?</i>

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.950
<i>Kotori, can you keep this for me?</i>

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.600
<i>But if Astral isn't there, then Hope...!</i>

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.580
<i>I won't give Astral to anyone.</i>

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.280
<i>I'm the only one who can protect him.</i>

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:26.990
Astral... Yuma said that he was going to protect you at all costs.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.400
That's why he gave the key to me...

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:29.580
<i>Yuma did...?</i>

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:33.700
<i>I see. So Yuma is trying to protect me...</i>

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.830
Astral...

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.020
<i>Kotori.</i>

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:40.500
<i>Right now, Yuma's facing a whole new threat all by himself.</i>

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.430
<i>I have to fight together with him...</i>

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:46.880
<i>I want you to bring me to Yuma.</i>

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.070
<i>Please, Kotori.</i>

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:52.600
Astral...

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.590
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:08.560
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.270
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:23.620
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:26.700
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:31.210
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:33.580
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.800
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:41.340
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:43.470
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:46.180
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.640
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.690
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:54.150
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:05:54.150 --> 00:06:00.190
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.950
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:04.410
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:09.120
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:18.170
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.870
<i>Hang in there, Yuma, Astral.</i>

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.870
<i>I'm counting on you... Kotori.</i>

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:47.800
"Prepare the Winning Formula
 Crush the Chaos Xyz!"

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:28.590
You're Kaito Tenjo, aren't you?

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:32.300
We're going to send you off to Hell for the Barian World!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.680
I'll eventually go to Hell some day anyway.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:37.220
That's where my guilty soul's going to end up one day.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:41.690
But I'm making sure that I take your Barian World with me!

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.150
Are you ready for your repentance?!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.110
Ryouga Kamishiro! What can you do all by yourself?!

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:56.580
It's because I have true faith in my friends that I can be here all by myself.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:01.460
Having to look at punks like you swarming together 
really gets on my nerves!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.620
Duel!!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:05.670
Shit...

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:12.470
I'll set one card and end my turn!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.100
Astral...

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:20.980
<i>He who opens this door shall obtain a new power.</i>

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.520
<i>However, as the price for this power...</i>

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.610
<i>...you shall lose that which is most important to you.</i>

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:33.320
I'm... I decided that I'm going to protect Astral no matter what!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.240
It's my turn! Draw!

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.910
Yes! A Monster Card!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.830
I'll set a Monster in Face-Down Defense Position!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.920
And I set one more card before ending my turn!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.170
<i>This should be able to hold off his next attack.</i>

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.920
I'll finish you off quick!

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.720
My turn! Draw!

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:00.720
I activate the Magic Card, Overlay Zero Buster, from my hand!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:07.730
With this card, if I control an Xyz Monster on the field without Overlay Units,

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.820
I can destroy one Monster my opponent controls!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:12.990
What?!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:19.910
Gogogo Gigas' been...!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.160
Yu...ma...

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:39.050
Astral... I'll take you... to where Yuma is right away!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.970
Bring it to them, Kotori!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:48.480
It's over! Go, Machine-Armored Djinn, Engeneral!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.610
Direct Attack him!

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:54.190
Trap, activate! Pinpoint Guard!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:56.780
I can use this card when my opponent attacks

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.530
to choose one Level Four or lower Monster in my Graveyard,

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.790
and Special Summon it in Defense Position with its effect negated!

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.500
I'm counting on you, Gogogo Gigas!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.040
Doom's Air Raid!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.550
It protected Yuma!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:19.260
Sorry, Gogogo Gigas.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.470
You impudent brat. I activate my Trap!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.930
Xyz Meteor!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:30.480
During this turn, if my Xyz Monster
attacks a Monster in Defense Position,

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:33.150
and its Defense Power is lower than my card's Attack Power,

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:36.240
the difference is inflicted to my opponent as Battle Damage!

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.830
Tch. Still hanging by a thread, are we?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:56.050
I'll activate the other effect of Xyz Meteor!

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.800
If a Monster affected by this card destroys a Monster,

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:03.260
I can draw one card!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:08.100
I'll set two cards! Turn end!

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:13.770
Shit...

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.690
<i>After all that talk about protecting Astral by myself...</i>

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:22.870
<i>What the heck is this?
 I can't do a single thing by myself...</i>

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.280
Yuma!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.120
Yuma!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.710
Kotori.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.460
Catch!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.350
That's...!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:46.600
Yuma!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:48.930
Yuma!

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:52.600
Hmm... The Duel's not even over and you're out of strength?

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.480
Astral...

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.070
A... Astral...

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.530
Yuma...

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:10.000
I... have to... protect you...

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:33.810
Astral...

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:38.020
So you finally showed yourself, Astral!

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:43.950
Astral... Why'd you come here?!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:47.450
E-Even without you here, I can still...

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.790
Yuma, why are you being so reckless?

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.750
I had... a dream.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.460
A dream?

00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:00.420
In my dream, I heard...

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:04.430
That I would lose what is most important to me.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.970
I'm sure that it wasn't your usual dream.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.850
So that's why I...

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:15.690
I'm sorry, Astral. All that talk...

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:18.650
And I... couldn't protect you.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:21.940
Yuma. I'm proud of you.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:27.910
This body of mine is the proof that I have a true friend.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:32.120
A friend who'll get himself hurt for me, and a friend who'll fight for my sake!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.080
Astral!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.120
I shall not forgive those...

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.800
...who hurt my friends!

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:50.050
Stand, Yuma!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.220
Astral...

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:04.030
Our Life hasn't been completely wiped out.

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.990
As usual, you're talking so arrogantly!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.530
Yuma, get up!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.330
How long are you going to sit around like that?!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:16.410
Really... Every one of you's always got something to say.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.670
Now get up! Stand up, Yuma!

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.880
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:37.350
Go Yuma! Astral!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:44.780
They just won't give up! They're actually still gonna keep going in such a situation!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:47.190
Yuma, what is that?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:47.740
That?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:53.450
That's a new Barian weapon
 that destroys Numbers called a Chaos Xyz.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:56.120
Chaos Xyz...

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.910
Interesting. Let's win, Yuma!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.330
Our winning formula is already prepared!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:05.050
Got it! My turn! Draw!

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:09.220
Morons! Are you really going to go
 ahead with just 100 Life Points?!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:12.680
Yuma! Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:16.600
I Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.360
Now the Magic Card from your hand!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:28.320
Right! I activate the Magic Card, Numbers Invocation!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:33.910
This card lets me release a Spellcaster-Type Monster,

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.790
to Special Summon a Number from my Graveyard!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:46.920
Revive! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:58.220
It's hopeless! You can't defeat a Chaos Xyz!

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:02.020
I'll activate the Permanent Trap, Xyz Hell Jail!

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:07.320
When an Xyz Monster is Special Summoned to the opponent's field,

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:11.780
this card seals that Monster's attacks,

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.910
and inflicts 500 damage to the opponent!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.240
What?!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:18.370
Now Hope's attacks have been sealed off!

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:21.620
and you have only 100 Life!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:25.080
That Life's fated to burn away at the end of this turn!

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.340
You think we'll let that happen?!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:32.510
When me and Astral are working together,
 our possibilities are endless!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:33.930
Let's go, Yuma!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:34.550
Yeah!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.890
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:41.850
Aspiring Emperor - Hope! Chaos Xyz Change!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.280
The Envoy that brings light to chaos!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.200
Show yourself! Chaos Number 39,

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.790
Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.220
Yes! It's Hope Ray!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.090
Go get 'em, Yuma!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:20.010
I'll activate Hope Ray's effect!

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:25.770
By detaching one Overlay Unit, 
his Attack Power increases by 500 points!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.270
Overlay Charge!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:32.530
And one of my opponent's Monsters loses 1000 points!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.950
Go! Hope Ray!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.570
Hope Sword Chaos Slash!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:46.330
Do you really think a Chaos Xyz is going to lose to a Number?!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.880
Trap, activate! Wild Charger!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:54.550
When one of my Xyz Monsters without Overlay Units is attacked,

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:58.510
that monster's Attack Power is added to the one of my Monsters!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:03.930
Now Engeneral's Attack Power is 4600!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.020
The leading Attack Points switched again!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.730
At this rate, Yuma will...

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:14.230
This is the end, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.190
We'll show you!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.450
My...

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:18.700
And my power!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:22.280
Quick-Play Magic! Numbers Impact!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.460
This card activates when a Numbers on our field

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.880
battles a Monster with 1000 or more Attack Points!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:37.340
Our Number gains the total Attack Power 
of the opponent's Monster!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:41.800
Impossible! That's 7600 Attack Points?!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:45.890
Finish him off! Hope Sword Chaos Slash!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.210
Yuma won!

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:14.920
Yuma!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.460
He won! He won, or not!

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:21.260
What a relief, Yuma, Astral.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:43.620
You...You don't really think that this is over, do you?

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.410
You probably forgot this...

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:50.210
That the Barian World's army is heading here!

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:55.420
Just a little longer! Soon they'll be swarming the place!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.630
You sure about that?

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:07.810
Those guys are...!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.980
Kaito! Shark!

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:13.480
Sorry, but your friends aren't coming.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:17.940
Right about now, your lackeys are having the time of their life inside their dreams!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.150
Im... Impossible.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:25.370
Our entire army lost to just two people?!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.710
N-No way...

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.800
As long as we're here,

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.760
we won't let you do as you please with this world!

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:45.680
Direct Attack.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.480
Another job done!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:20:59.570
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:03.030
<i>I didn't expect them to all be beaten.</i>

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:06.030
<i>But the real fun's only just begun.</i>

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:10.080
<i>Yuma Tsukumo! Kaito Tenjo! Ryouga Kamishiro!</i>

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:16.210
It seems that, like Dr. Faker,

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.170
his mind was also being controlled by Barian.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.210
Barian...

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.670
- Yuma!
 - Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.090
You did it, Yuma!

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:28.640
Darling, you were lovely!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.720
The Barians got nothing on me!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:34.770
<i>Nothing</i>, right?

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.230
Yuma.

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:41.190
It seems like they've finally started making their move.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:43.190
Those assassins from the Barian World.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.700
Kaito. Shark.

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.660
The fight's just getting started.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.990
Right! It doesn't matter who shows up!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:54.700
If we work together, there's no way we'll lose!

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:58.170
Let 'em bring as many as they want!

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:01.420
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:24.150
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:31.830
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:39.420
<i>Do you laugh at my "impossible" dream?</i>

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:46.760
<i>I must be pretty laughable for not being able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.300 --> 00:23:03.690
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:18.830
<i>As long as I live, I will always be your little friend</i>

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:27.380
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:32.180
<i>I will become the artist</i>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.480
<i>Just do what you want</i>

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:43.520
A transfer student has arrived in my class!

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:46.690
But he's an unbelievable trouble maker!

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:49.950
Man, just gimme a break already!

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:52.200
I hear a Pro Duelist's coming here!

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.990
I so wanna Duel him!

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:56.450
Is he being controlled by Barian?!

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:58.040
A new Chaos Xyz?!

00:23:58.040 --> 00:24:00.830
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:05.710
"It's For the Best!
 Rei Shingetsu Has Arrived"

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:07.840
You're my friend!
